flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> check{Valid?}
    check -->|yes| user_db[(User DB)]
    check -. no .-> fail[/Reject/]
    user_db ==> done((Done))
    subgraph svc [Services]
        api[API] --> worker[[Worker]]
    end
    done --> api
    fail --x done
    worker --o start
    api <--> check
    click api "https://example.com/api"
